[
  {
    "index": 0,
    "text": "♪ Meow, meow, meow, meow, meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 1,
    "text": "♪ Hey, Gabby ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 2,
    "text": "♪ Take us to the Dollhouse ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 3,
    "text": "♪ Hey, Gabby ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 4,
    "text": "♪ Little by little"
  },
  {
    "index": 5,
    "text": "Let's live in the meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 6,
    "text": "-♪ Meow, meow, meow, meow, meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 7,
    "text": "-♪ Meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 8,
    "text": "-♪ Meow, meow, meow, meow, meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 9,
    "text": "-♪ Meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 10,
    "text": "♪ Meow, meow, meow, meow, meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 11,
    "text": "-♪ Hey, Gabby ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 12,
    "text": "-♪ Meow, meow, meow, meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 13,
    "text": "-♪ What's the big surprise? ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 14,
    "text": "-♪ Meow, meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 15,
    "text": "♪ Let's shrink right down and go inside ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 16,
    "text": "♪ Hey, Gabby ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 17,
    "text": "♪ Meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 18,
    "text": "Oh, hi! I'm so glad you're here."
  },
  {
    "index": 19,
    "text": "I was just about to read"
  },
  {
    "index": 20,
    "text": "Pandy and Floyd's favorite story,"
  },
  {
    "index": 21,
    "text": "The Wonderful Wizard of Meow."
  },
  {
    "index": 22,
    "text": "It's all about a girl"
  },
  {
    "index": 23,
    "text": "with magical sparkly shoes"
  },
  {
    "index": 24,
    "text": "who needs to go to the Emerald City"
  },
  {
    "index": 25,
    "text": "to meet a Wizard"
  },
  {
    "index": 26,
    "text": "who can make her wish come true."
  },
  {
    "index": 27,
    "text": "Along the way,"
  },
  {
    "index": 28,
    "text": "she meets a Scarecrow,"
  },
  {
    "index": 29,
    "text": "a Tin Man, and a Lion."
  },
  {
    "index": 30,
    "text": "There's even a Witch,"
  },
  {
    "index": 31,
    "text": "who's full of surprises."
  },
  {
    "index": 32,
    "text": "Do you want to read the story with us?"
  },
  {
    "index": 33,
    "text": "Great."
  },
  {
    "index": 34,
    "text": "The Wonderful Wizard of Meow."
  },
  {
    "index": 35,
    "text": "\"Once upon a time…\""
  },
  {
    "index": 36,
    "text": "Hmm. Wait a minute."
  },
  {
    "index": 37,
    "text": "That's strange."
  },
  {
    "index": 38,
    "text": "All the pages are blank."
  },
  {
    "index": 39,
    "text": "There's no story in here."
  },
  {
    "index": 40,
    "text": "We've got to figure this out."
  },
  {
    "index": 41,
    "text": "-♪ Meow, meow, meow, meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 42,
    "text": "-Oh! It's a Dollhouse Delivery."
  },
  {
    "index": 43,
    "text": "Maybe that will give a clue"
  },
  {
    "index": 44,
    "text": "about what happened to our missing story."
  },
  {
    "index": 45,
    "text": "We'll be back, Floyd. Come on."
  },
  {
    "index": 46,
    "text": "♪ Meow, meow, meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 47,
    "text": "♪ Meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 48,
    "text": "♪ Meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 49,
    "text": "♪ Meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 50,
    "text": "All right. Let's see what our"
  },
  {
    "index": 51,
    "text": "Meow Meow Mailbox has for us today."
  },
  {
    "index": 52,
    "text": "Whoa! Check it out!"
  },
  {
    "index": 53,
    "text": "Our Kitty Cat Surprise Box"
  },
  {
    "index": 54,
    "text": "looks like a lion."
  },
  {
    "index": 55,
    "text": "Just like…"
  },
  {
    "index": 56,
    "text": "The Lion in our story."
  },
  {
    "index": 57,
    "text": "I wonder what that means?"
  },
  {
    "index": 58,
    "text": "Should we open it up"
  },
  {
    "index": 59,
    "text": "and see what's inside?"
  },
  {
    "index": 60,
    "text": "Let's do it."
  },
  {
    "index": 61,
    "text": "There's two teeny-tiny sneakers."
  },
  {
    "index": 62,
    "text": "They're so sparkly and rainbow-y."
  },
  {
    "index": 63,
    "text": "-What's this?"
  },
  {
    "index": 64,
    "text": "-Hey, hey, hey!"
  },
  {
    "index": 65,
    "text": "-To find your missing story…"
  },
  {
    "index": 66,
    "text": "-Oh!"
  },
  {
    "index": 67,
    "text": "…your adventure is starting now."
  },
  {
    "index": 68,
    "text": "Prepare for a magical journey"
  },
  {
    "index": 69,
    "text": "to the mysterious Wizard of Meow!"
  },
  {
    "index": 70,
    "text": "A toodley-doo!"
  },
  {
    "index": 71,
    "text": "The Wizard of Meow?"
  },
  {
    "index": 72,
    "text": "He's the one who grants wishes."
  },
  {
    "index": 73,
    "text": "Maybe he can bring our missing story back."
  },
  {
    "index": 74,
    "text": "Do you want to go on an adventure"
  },
  {
    "index": 75,
    "text": "and find the Wizard of Meow?"
  },
  {
    "index": 76,
    "text": "Cat-tastic!"
  },
  {
    "index": 77,
    "text": "Then I guess we're off to see the Wizard."
  },
  {
    "index": 78,
    "text": "It's time to get tiny."
  },
  {
    "index": 79,
    "text": "♪ A pinch on my left"
  },
  {
    "index": 80,
    "text": "Pinch, pinch on my right ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 81,
    "text": "♪ Grab Pandy's hand and hold on tight! ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 82,
    "text": "I'm down here, in front of the Dollhouse."
  },
  {
    "index": 83,
    "text": "Come on in."
  },
  {
    "index": 84,
    "text": "Check me out!"
  },
  {
    "index": 85,
    "text": "I'm dressed like the girl from our story."
  },
  {
    "index": 86,
    "text": "And I'm wearing"
  },
  {
    "index": 87,
    "text": "the sparkly rainbow sneakers."
  },
  {
    "index": 88,
    "text": "What do you think, Pandy?"
  },
  {
    "index": 89,
    "text": "Hmm. Do you see Pandy?"
  },
  {
    "index": 90,
    "text": "Scarecrow hug attack!"
  },
  {
    "index": 91,
    "text": "Whoa, Pandy!"
  },
  {
    "index": 92,
    "text": "You look just like the Scarecrow"
  },
  {
    "index": 93,
    "text": "from our story."
  },
  {
    "index": 94,
    "text": "You know it! Give me a straw paw."
  },
  {
    "index": 95,
    "text": "Pi-cha!"
  },
  {
    "index": 96,
    "text": "Okay, Pandy,"
  },
  {
    "index": 97,
    "text": "you're the expert on this story."
  },
  {
    "index": 98,
    "text": "How do we find the Wizard of Meow?"
  },
  {
    "index": 99,
    "text": "Your sparkly shoes."
  },
  {
    "index": 100,
    "text": "In the story, they have magical powers."
  },
  {
    "index": 101,
    "text": "Really?"
  },
  {
    "index": 102,
    "text": "Uh… Try clicking them three times."
  },
  {
    "index": 103,
    "text": "Okay. Count to three with me."
  },
  {
    "index": 104,
    "text": "One, two, three!"
  },
  {
    "index": 105,
    "text": "Whoa! Something's happening!"
  },
  {
    "index": 106,
    "text": "Meowzers!"
  },
  {
    "index": 107,
    "text": "It's a Rainbow Glittery Trail!"
  },
  {
    "index": 108,
    "text": "Come on!"
  },
  {
    "index": 109,
    "text": "♪ We're on our way to see"
  },
  {
    "index": 110,
    "text": "The Wonderful Wizard of Meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 111,
    "text": "♪ Meow! ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 112,
    "text": "♪ Can you believe ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 113,
    "text": "♪ The cat-tastic magic all around? ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 114,
    "text": "♪ Whoa! Whoo! ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 115,
    "text": "♪ Just follow the Glittery Trail"
  },
  {
    "index": 116,
    "text": "To meet the Wizard ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 117,
    "text": "♪ A classic tale ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 118,
    "text": "♪ We'll skip and sing along"
  },
  {
    "index": 119,
    "text": "To a glittery kitty song ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 120,
    "text": "♪ Whoo! ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 121,
    "text": "Sparkling sea creatures!"
  },
  {
    "index": 122,
    "text": "-Hi, everyone."
  },
  {
    "index": 123,
    "text": "-Hi, MerCat."
  },
  {
    "index": 124,
    "text": "We're following the Rainbow Glittery Trail"
  },
  {
    "index": 125,
    "text": "to find the Wonderful Wizard of Meow."
  },
  {
    "index": 126,
    "text": "The Wonderful Wizard of Meow?"
  },
  {
    "index": 127,
    "text": "Yep. We need to find him"
  },
  {
    "index": 128,
    "text": "so he can bring our missing story back."
  },
  {
    "index": 129,
    "text": "Oh, my!"
  },
  {
    "index": 130,
    "text": "I'm playing the Scarecrow from the story,"
  },
  {
    "index": 131,
    "text": "and Gabby is the little girl"
  },
  {
    "index": 132,
    "text": "with the sparkly shoes."
  },
  {
    "index": 133,
    "text": "Love the sparkle, Gabs. Oh!"
  },
  {
    "index": 134,
    "text": "Now, who's that there, in the witch's hat?"
  },
  {
    "index": 135,
    "text": "That's the Bad Witch."
  },
  {
    "index": 136,
    "text": "Oh! Can I play the Witch? Please?"
  },
  {
    "index": 137,
    "text": "I do love a hat moment."
  },
  {
    "index": 138,
    "text": "Okay. But she is a Bad Witch."
  },
  {
    "index": 139,
    "text": "Not a problem."
  },
  {
    "index": 140,
    "text": "Ooh!"
  },
  {
    "index": 141,
    "text": "Now I'm MerCat the Bad Witch."
  },
  {
    "index": 142,
    "text": "I'll get you, my kitties!"
  },
  {
    "index": 143,
    "text": "Um… Okay. That's definitely witchy."
  },
  {
    "index": 144,
    "text": "Hang on!"
  },
  {
    "index": 145,
    "text": "Ooh. What's that?"
  },
  {
    "index": 146,
    "text": "This is my magic bubble."
  },
  {
    "index": 147,
    "text": "I can see everything that happens in here."
  },
  {
    "index": 148,
    "text": "Let's see"
  },
  {
    "index": 149,
    "text": "what your Wizard of Meow is up to."
  },
  {
    "index": 150,
    "text": "-Ooh!"
  },
  {
    "index": 151,
    "text": "-There he is!"
  },
  {
    "index": 152,
    "text": "I am the great and paw-esome"
  },
  {
    "index": 153,
    "text": "Wizard of Meow."
  },
  {
    "index": 154,
    "text": "Ooh!"
  },
  {
    "index": 155,
    "text": "If you want me to grant your wish,"
  },
  {
    "index": 156,
    "text": "you must bring me three things."
  },
  {
    "index": 157,
    "text": "Something sweet,"
  },
  {
    "index": 158,
    "text": "something cone-shaped,"
  },
  {
    "index": 159,
    "text": "and something cold."
  },
  {
    "index": 160,
    "text": "Oh, great Wizard of Meow,"
  },
  {
    "index": 161,
    "text": "we don't know where you are."
  },
  {
    "index": 162,
    "text": "Keep following the Rainbow Glittery Trail,"
  },
  {
    "index": 163,
    "text": "of course."
  },
  {
    "index": 164,
    "text": "The Rainbow Glittery Trail! Come on!"
  },
  {
    "index": 165,
    "text": "-Bye, MerCat."
  },
  {
    "index": 166,
    "text": "-Hmm."
  },
  {
    "index": 167,
    "text": "Looks like it's up to MerCat the Bad Witch"
  },
  {
    "index": 168,
    "text": "to stop those little kitties"
  },
  {
    "index": 169,
    "text": "before they reach the Wizard."
  },
  {
    "index": 170,
    "text": "Time to brew up some trouble."
  },
  {
    "index": 171,
    "text": "♪ Follow the Glittery Trail"
  },
  {
    "index": 172,
    "text": "To meet the Wizard ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 173,
    "text": "♪ A classic tale ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 174,
    "text": "♪ We'll skip and sing along"
  },
  {
    "index": 175,
    "text": "To a glittery kitty song ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 176,
    "text": "♪ Whoo! ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 177,
    "text": "Hey, it took us right to the kitchen."
  },
  {
    "index": 178,
    "text": "What are the three things"
  },
  {
    "index": 179,
    "text": "we need to bring to the Wizard again?"
  },
  {
    "index": 180,
    "text": "Something sweet,"
  },
  {
    "index": 181,
    "text": "something cone-shaped,"
  },
  {
    "index": 182,
    "text": "and something cold."
  },
  {
    "index": 183,
    "text": "Well, Cakey can definitely help us"
  },
  {
    "index": 184,
    "text": "with the something sweet."
  },
  {
    "index": 185,
    "text": "Looking for Cakey?"
  },
  {
    "index": 186,
    "text": "Well, today,"
  },
  {
    "index": 187,
    "text": "I'm part of the Lunchin' Munchkins team."
  },
  {
    "index": 188,
    "text": "Oh, Munchkins!"
  },
  {
    "index": 189,
    "text": "I'm Bakey."
  },
  {
    "index": 190,
    "text": "I'm Flakey."
  },
  {
    "index": 191,
    "text": "I'm Marshapan."
  },
  {
    "index": 192,
    "text": "And I'm Paddycake."
  },
  {
    "index": 193,
    "text": "♪ We are the Lunchin' Munchkins ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 194,
    "text": "♪ This spunky bunch can show you"
  },
  {
    "index": 195,
    "text": "How we make what you're munchin' ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 196,
    "text": "♪ It's crunch time"
  },
  {
    "index": 197,
    "text": "'Cause lunchtime is now ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 198,
    "text": "We're gonna make some lunch right now."
  },
  {
    "index": 199,
    "text": "-♪ Whoo! ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 200,
    "text": "-Whoa!"
  },
  {
    "index": 201,
    "text": "Hey, Munchkins."
  },
  {
    "index": 202,
    "text": "We're on our way to see the Wizard,"
  },
  {
    "index": 203,
    "text": "and we need to bring him something sweet."
  },
  {
    "index": 204,
    "text": "-We were hoping you could help us out."
  },
  {
    "index": 205,
    "text": "-Our strawberry syrup is sweet."
  },
  {
    "index": 206,
    "text": "That's perfect."
  },
  {
    "index": 207,
    "text": "Wait! We might need that for our lunch."
  },
  {
    "index": 208,
    "text": "-What are you making?"
  },
  {
    "index": 209,
    "text": "-Hmm."
  },
  {
    "index": 210,
    "text": "-Let's see."
  },
  {
    "index": 211,
    "text": "-What should we make today?"
  },
  {
    "index": 212,
    "text": "I've got it!"
  },
  {
    "index": 213,
    "text": "How about a kitty pizza?"
  },
  {
    "index": 214,
    "text": "Oh! And some strawberry milk."
  },
  {
    "index": 215,
    "text": "Sounds delicious!"
  },
  {
    "index": 216,
    "text": "I have an idea."
  },
  {
    "index": 217,
    "text": "What if Pandy and I"
  },
  {
    "index": 218,
    "text": "help you make your lunch,"
  },
  {
    "index": 219,
    "text": "and then maybe"
  },
  {
    "index": 220,
    "text": "we could take the strawberry syrup?"
  },
  {
    "index": 221,
    "text": "-Oh, okay."
  },
  {
    "index": 222,
    "text": "-Let's shake on it."
  },
  {
    "index": 223,
    "text": "It's a deal!"
  },
  {
    "index": 224,
    "text": "Oh, no!"
  },
  {
    "index": 225,
    "text": "If Gabby and Pandy get the syrup,"
  },
  {
    "index": 226,
    "text": "they'll be that much closer"
  },
  {
    "index": 227,
    "text": "to getting their wish from the Wizard."
  },
  {
    "index": 228,
    "text": "I need to stop them."
  },
  {
    "index": 229,
    "text": "My Tricky Trouble Bubbles"
  },
  {
    "index": 230,
    "text": "will be just the thing."
  },
  {
    "index": 231,
    "text": "Hee-hee-hee!"
  },
  {
    "index": 232,
    "text": "How do you like that lunch"
  },
  {
    "index": 233,
    "text": "with a side of Tricky Trouble Bubbles?"
  },
  {
    "index": 234,
    "text": "Uh-oh!"
  },
  {
    "index": 235,
    "text": "Enjoy!"
  },
  {
    "index": 236,
    "text": "Oh, no! All our food is floating away!"
  },
  {
    "index": 237,
    "text": "Now we can't make our pizza lunch."
  },
  {
    "index": 238,
    "text": "Hmm. I've got an idea."
  },
  {
    "index": 239,
    "text": "If we can find the floating ingredients"
  },
  {
    "index": 240,
    "text": "we need to make pizza,"
  },
  {
    "index": 241,
    "text": "we can pop those bubbles"
  },
  {
    "index": 242,
    "text": "and catch the ingredients."
  },
  {
    "index": 243,
    "text": "Yay, Gabby! Lunch is saved!"
  },
  {
    "index": 244,
    "text": "Let's start with the crust."
  },
  {
    "index": 245,
    "text": "What can we use"
  },
  {
    "index": 246,
    "text": "to make the best pizza crust?"
  },
  {
    "index": 247,
    "text": "Dough, macaroni, or a rice cake?"
  },
  {
    "index": 248,
    "text": "The dough."
  },
  {
    "index": 249,
    "text": "Lunchin' Munchkins to the rescue!"
  },
  {
    "index": 250,
    "text": "Whee!"
  },
  {
    "index": 251,
    "text": "Got it!"
  },
  {
    "index": 252,
    "text": "Okay. Which of these do we need"
  },
  {
    "index": 253,
    "text": "for our pizza?"
  },
  {
    "index": 254,
    "text": "Strawberry syrup,"
  },
  {
    "index": 255,
    "text": "sunflower butter, or tomato sauce?"
  },
  {
    "index": 256,
    "text": "Tomato sauce! Yeah!"
  },
  {
    "index": 257,
    "text": "On it!"
  },
  {
    "index": 258,
    "text": "Got it!"
  },
  {
    "index": 259,
    "text": "We need one more important ingredient"
  },
  {
    "index": 260,
    "text": "to put on top."
  },
  {
    "index": 261,
    "text": "We need cheese!"
  },
  {
    "index": 262,
    "text": "Easy-peasy, nice and cheesy."
  },
  {
    "index": 263,
    "text": "Just needs the kitty face."
  },
  {
    "index": 264,
    "text": "Two olive eyes."
  },
  {
    "index": 265,
    "text": "And red peppers for the nose,"
  },
  {
    "index": 266,
    "text": "mouth, and whiskers."
  },
  {
    "index": 267,
    "text": "Ooh!"
  },
  {
    "index": 268,
    "text": "And some basil for the ears."
  },
  {
    "index": 269,
    "text": "Ready for baking!"
  },
  {
    "index": 270,
    "text": "Ooh! Can't forget the strawberry milk."
  },
  {
    "index": 271,
    "text": "-Thanks, Gabby! Thanks, Pandy!"
  },
  {
    "index": 272,
    "text": "-Aww!"
  },
  {
    "index": 273,
    "text": "-Do you want to stay for lunch?"
  },
  {
    "index": 274,
    "text": "-We'd love to, Paddycake."
  },
  {
    "index": 275,
    "text": "But we really need"
  },
  {
    "index": 276,
    "text": "to get to the Wizard of Meow."
  },
  {
    "index": 277,
    "text": "So he can bring our story back."
  },
  {
    "index": 278,
    "text": "A deal's a deal."
  },
  {
    "index": 279,
    "text": "Here's your sweet strawberry syrup."
  },
  {
    "index": 280,
    "text": "Aww! Thanks."
  },
  {
    "index": 281,
    "text": "Look! The Rainbow Glittery Trail!"
  },
  {
    "index": 282,
    "text": "Bye, everybody."
  },
  {
    "index": 283,
    "text": "Good luck!"
  },
  {
    "index": 284,
    "text": "Bye-bye!"
  },
  {
    "index": 285,
    "text": "♪ Follow the Glittery Trail"
  },
  {
    "index": 286,
    "text": "To meet the Wizard ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 287,
    "text": "♪ A classic tale ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 288,
    "text": "♪ We'll skip and sing along"
  },
  {
    "index": 289,
    "text": "To a glittery kitty song ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 290,
    "text": "♪ Whoo! ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 291,
    "text": "Hi, Baby Box."
  },
  {
    "index": 292,
    "text": "Hey there."
  },
  {
    "index": 293,
    "text": "Nice costume. Are you in our story too?"
  },
  {
    "index": 294,
    "text": "You know it!"
  },
  {
    "index": 295,
    "text": "I'm the Tin Man,"
  },
  {
    "index": 296,
    "text": "but I like to call myself Baby Tin Box."
  },
  {
    "index": 297,
    "text": "It's nice to meet you, Baby Tin Box."
  },
  {
    "index": 298,
    "text": "Baby Tin Box, maybe you can help us."
  },
  {
    "index": 299,
    "text": "We're on our way to the Wizard of Meow,"
  },
  {
    "index": 300,
    "text": "and we need something cone-shaped."
  },
  {
    "index": 301,
    "text": "Cone-shaped, you say?"
  },
  {
    "index": 302,
    "text": "Well, I can make all kinds of things"
  },
  {
    "index": 303,
    "text": "with my craft paper."
  },
  {
    "index": 304,
    "text": "Hang on."
  },
  {
    "index": 305,
    "text": "Ta-da!"
  },
  {
    "index": 306,
    "text": "Wow!"
  },
  {
    "index": 307,
    "text": "Nicely done."
  },
  {
    "index": 308,
    "text": "Help us look for the right shape."
  },
  {
    "index": 309,
    "text": "Do you see something"
  },
  {
    "index": 310,
    "text": "in the shape of a cone?"
  },
  {
    "index": 311,
    "text": "Yeah. This one"
  },
  {
    "index": 312,
    "text": "looks just like a paper ice-cream cone."
  },
  {
    "index": 313,
    "text": "Thanks, Baby Tin Box."
  },
  {
    "index": 314,
    "text": "And now we have something sweet"
  },
  {
    "index": 315,
    "text": "and something cone-shaped."
  },
  {
    "index": 316,
    "text": "Uh-oh! They almost have"
  },
  {
    "index": 317,
    "text": "everything they need to see the Wizard."
  },
  {
    "index": 318,
    "text": "Hmm. Looks like I need something new"
  },
  {
    "index": 319,
    "text": "to stop them this time."
  },
  {
    "index": 320,
    "text": "Something sticky this way comes!"
  },
  {
    "index": 321,
    "text": "Eee-hee-hee-hee!"
  },
  {
    "index": 322,
    "text": "Uh-oh! More Tricky Trouble Bubbles?"
  },
  {
    "index": 323,
    "text": "I wonder what trouble"
  },
  {
    "index": 324,
    "text": "these are gonna cause?"
  },
  {
    "index": 325,
    "text": "Whoa!"
  },
  {
    "index": 326,
    "text": "Oh, no! These bubbles are super sticky!"
  },
  {
    "index": 327,
    "text": "W-Whoa!"
  },
  {
    "index": 328,
    "text": "Whoa!"
  },
  {
    "index": 329,
    "text": "Now we're all sticky!"
  },
  {
    "index": 330,
    "text": "Oh, no. We're…"
  },
  {
    "index": 331,
    "text": "…stuck together!"
  },
  {
    "index": 332,
    "text": "Oh, snippets!"
  },
  {
    "index": 333,
    "text": "Whoa!"
  },
  {
    "index": 334,
    "text": "Whoa! Phew!"
  },
  {
    "index": 335,
    "text": "I almost rolled away."
  },
  {
    "index": 336,
    "text": "What are we going to do, Gabby?"
  },
  {
    "index": 337,
    "text": "I don't know, yet."
  },
  {
    "index": 338,
    "text": "Hmm. Aha! How about this?"
  },
  {
    "index": 339,
    "text": "Baby Tin Box,"
  },
  {
    "index": 340,
    "text": "if you can roll like a super fast wheel,"
  },
  {
    "index": 341,
    "text": "maybe those craft sticks…"
  },
  {
    "index": 342,
    "text": "…will cut through the goo"
  },
  {
    "index": 343,
    "text": "between me and Pandy."
  },
  {
    "index": 344,
    "text": "It's worth a shot."
  },
  {
    "index": 345,
    "text": "On the count of three."
  },
  {
    "index": 346,
    "text": "One,"
  },
  {
    "index": 347,
    "text": "two,"
  },
  {
    "index": 348,
    "text": "three!"
  },
  {
    "index": 349,
    "text": "I did it!"
  },
  {
    "index": 350,
    "text": "You sure did."
  },
  {
    "index": 351,
    "text": "Wahoo!"
  },
  {
    "index": 352,
    "text": "Meowzers!"
  },
  {
    "index": 353,
    "text": "-Thanks, Baby Tin Box."
  },
  {
    "index": 354,
    "text": "-You're welcome."
  },
  {
    "index": 355,
    "text": "Bye-bye."
  },
  {
    "index": 356,
    "text": "Good luck getting to the Wizard!"
  },
  {
    "index": 357,
    "text": "♪ Follow the Glittery Trail"
  },
  {
    "index": 358,
    "text": "To meet the Wizard ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 359,
    "text": "♪ A classic tale ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 360,
    "text": "♪ We'll skip and sing along"
  },
  {
    "index": 361,
    "text": "To a glittery kitty song, whoo! ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 362,
    "text": "Roar!"
  },
  {
    "index": 363,
    "text": "Did you hear that? It sounded like a lion."
  },
  {
    "index": 364,
    "text": "Ta-da! It's Marty the Party Lion."
  },
  {
    "index": 365,
    "text": "Roar!"
  },
  {
    "index": 366,
    "text": "Wow, Marty!"
  },
  {
    "index": 367,
    "text": "You make a roar-some Lion."
  },
  {
    "index": 368,
    "text": "I hear you're headed to the Emerald City"
  },
  {
    "index": 369,
    "text": "to see the Wizard."
  },
  {
    "index": 370,
    "text": "I thought you might need"
  },
  {
    "index": 371,
    "text": "a brave Marty Lion to protect you."
  },
  {
    "index": 372,
    "text": "Roar!"
  },
  {
    "index": 373,
    "text": "It couldn't hurt. Come on."
  },
  {
    "index": 374,
    "text": "Okay, Marty,"
  },
  {
    "index": 375,
    "text": "the Wizard asked us for three things."
  },
  {
    "index": 376,
    "text": "Something sweet,"
  },
  {
    "index": 377,
    "text": "something cone-shaped…"
  },
  {
    "index": 378,
    "text": "…and something cold."
  },
  {
    "index": 379,
    "text": "We still need to find something cold"
  },
  {
    "index": 380,
    "text": "before we get to Emerald City,"
  },
  {
    "index": 381,
    "text": "so keep an eye out."
  },
  {
    "index": 382,
    "text": "Something cold, huh?"
  },
  {
    "index": 383,
    "text": "Well, I've got something cold"
  },
  {
    "index": 384,
    "text": "that will make sure"
  },
  {
    "index": 385,
    "text": "they never find their way to Emerald City."
  },
  {
    "index": 386,
    "text": "How about some"
  },
  {
    "index": 387,
    "text": "Blizzard Bubbles!"
  },
  {
    "index": 388,
    "text": "Hello, my kitties."
  },
  {
    "index": 389,
    "text": "Oh, no! It's the Bad Witch!"
  },
  {
    "index": 390,
    "text": "Get ready for some Blizzard Bubbles!"
  },
  {
    "index": 391,
    "text": "Blizzard Bubbles?"
  },
  {
    "index": 392,
    "text": "That doesn't sound good."
  },
  {
    "index": 393,
    "text": "I can't believe it! It's real snow! Brr!"
  },
  {
    "index": 394,
    "text": "Pandy, that's it!"
  },
  {
    "index": 395,
    "text": "That snowball is our…"
  },
  {
    "index": 396,
    "text": "…something cold!"
  },
  {
    "index": 397,
    "text": "We've got everything the Wizard asked for."
  },
  {
    "index": 398,
    "text": "Come on. Next stop, Emerald City."
  },
  {
    "index": 399,
    "text": "Uh… Gabby,"
  },
  {
    "index": 400,
    "text": "I think we might have a problem."
  },
  {
    "index": 401,
    "text": "One of those green doors"
  },
  {
    "index": 402,
    "text": "is the door to Emerald City,"
  },
  {
    "index": 403,
    "text": "where the Wizard lives."
  },
  {
    "index": 404,
    "text": "Yeah, but the trail's covered in snow."
  },
  {
    "index": 405,
    "text": "We can't see the path to the right door."
  },
  {
    "index": 406,
    "text": "And we were so close."
  },
  {
    "index": 407,
    "text": "Hang on, my little Scarecrow pal."
  },
  {
    "index": 408,
    "text": "I remember, in the story,"
  },
  {
    "index": 409,
    "text": "the door to the Emerald City"
  },
  {
    "index": 410,
    "text": "has a window shaped like a rectangle."
  },
  {
    "index": 411,
    "text": "Let's see."
  },
  {
    "index": 412,
    "text": "Which window is shaped like a rectangle?"
  },
  {
    "index": 413,
    "text": "That's the one."
  },
  {
    "index": 414,
    "text": "That means"
  },
  {
    "index": 415,
    "text": "this is the door to Emerald City!"
  },
  {
    "index": 416,
    "text": "Marty the Lion, you roar!"
  },
  {
    "index": 417,
    "text": "What do you think, Pandy?"
  },
  {
    "index": 418,
    "text": "Do you want to give it a knock?"
  },
  {
    "index": 419,
    "text": "Ooh! I'm so excited."
  },
  {
    "index": 420,
    "text": "Hey! Who goes there?"
  },
  {
    "index": 421,
    "text": "It's Pandy the Scarecrow, Marty the Lion,"
  },
  {
    "index": 422,
    "text": "and Gabby,"
  },
  {
    "index": 423,
    "text": "the girl with the sparkly shoes."
  },
  {
    "index": 424,
    "text": "-We're here to see the Wizard of Meow."
  },
  {
    "index": 425,
    "text": "-Hmm."
  },
  {
    "index": 426,
    "text": "Well, did you bring"
  },
  {
    "index": 427,
    "text": "everything he asked for?"
  },
  {
    "index": 428,
    "text": "Yep. It's all right here in my basket."
  },
  {
    "index": 429,
    "text": "Well, in that case,"
  },
  {
    "index": 430,
    "text": "welcome to Emerald City!"
  },
  {
    "index": 431,
    "text": "-Whoa!"
  },
  {
    "index": 432,
    "text": "-We're going to Emerald City!"
  },
  {
    "index": 433,
    "text": "Good luck."
  },
  {
    "index": 434,
    "text": "-Thanks for all your help."
  },
  {
    "index": 435,
    "text": "-Bye."
  },
  {
    "index": 436,
    "text": "Pandy, I don't think"
  },
  {
    "index": 437,
    "text": "we're in the Dollhouse anymore."
  },
  {
    "index": 438,
    "text": "Check out that giant castle."
  },
  {
    "index": 439,
    "text": "That's where the Wizard lives."
  },
  {
    "index": 440,
    "text": "Let's go!"
  },
  {
    "index": 441,
    "text": "Not so fast, my kitties."
  },
  {
    "index": 442,
    "text": "MerCat the Bad Witch!"
  },
  {
    "index": 443,
    "text": "That's me, here to keep you from getting"
  },
  {
    "index": 444,
    "text": "to the Wizard inside that castle"
  },
  {
    "index": 445,
    "text": "with my Wall of Tricky Trouble Bubbles!"
  },
  {
    "index": 446,
    "text": "Oh, no!"
  },
  {
    "index": 447,
    "text": "I guess"
  },
  {
    "index": 448,
    "text": "we'll never reach the Wizard now."
  },
  {
    "index": 449,
    "text": "But we're so close."
  },
  {
    "index": 450,
    "text": "We've just got to"
  },
  {
    "index": 451,
    "text": "get our missing story back."
  },
  {
    "index": 452,
    "text": "I promised Floyd."
  },
  {
    "index": 453,
    "text": "This is breaking my heart."
  },
  {
    "index": 454,
    "text": "I don't want to be the Bad Witch anymore."
  },
  {
    "index": 455,
    "text": "Hang on."
  },
  {
    "index": 456,
    "text": "There! That's better."
  },
  {
    "index": 457,
    "text": "It's MerCat the Good Witch from now on."
  },
  {
    "index": 458,
    "text": "Tricky Trouble Bubbles, be gone!"
  },
  {
    "index": 459,
    "text": "Yay for MerCat the Good Witch!"
  },
  {
    "index": 460,
    "text": "Wahoo!"
  },
  {
    "index": 461,
    "text": "Now you're off to see the Wizard"
  },
  {
    "index": 462,
    "text": "inside the shiny castle."
  },
  {
    "index": 463,
    "text": "Go get your story back."
  },
  {
    "index": 464,
    "text": "Thanks, MerCat."
  },
  {
    "index": 465,
    "text": "Wizard of Meow, here we come!"
  },
  {
    "index": 466,
    "text": "Ooh! The Wizard must be here somewhere."
  },
  {
    "index": 467,
    "text": "It is I, behind the curtain,"
  },
  {
    "index": 468,
    "text": "the great and powerful Wizard of Meow!"
  },
  {
    "index": 469,
    "text": "Um… Mr. Wizard,"
  },
  {
    "index": 470,
    "text": "we brought the three things you asked for."
  },
  {
    "index": 471,
    "text": "Pass them through the curtain, Scarecrow."
  },
  {
    "index": 472,
    "text": "This is gonna be good."
  },
  {
    "index": 473,
    "text": "CatRat?"
  },
  {
    "index": 474,
    "text": "You're the Wizard?"
  },
  {
    "index": 475,
    "text": "And you're using the stuff we brought you"
  },
  {
    "index": 476,
    "text": "to make a snack?"
  },
  {
    "index": 477,
    "text": "Uh… Well… yes."
  },
  {
    "index": 478,
    "text": "It is me, the Great Wizard of Meow!"
  },
  {
    "index": 479,
    "text": "But you can still grant our wish"
  },
  {
    "index": 480,
    "text": "and fix our storybook, right?"
  },
  {
    "index": 481,
    "text": "Uh… Well, about that…"
  },
  {
    "index": 482,
    "text": "You see, I'm only playing a Wizard."
  },
  {
    "index": 483,
    "text": "I don't really have any magical powers"
  },
  {
    "index": 484,
    "text": "of the wish-granting kind."
  },
  {
    "index": 485,
    "text": "You've got to be kitten me!"
  },
  {
    "index": 486,
    "text": "But we came all this way."
  },
  {
    "index": 487,
    "text": "Okay, okay. Uh…"
  },
  {
    "index": 488,
    "text": "Let me take a look. Hmm."
  },
  {
    "index": 489,
    "text": "Your story, huh?"
  },
  {
    "index": 490,
    "text": "Why don't you tell me about it?"
  },
  {
    "index": 491,
    "text": "Well, first,"
  },
  {
    "index": 492,
    "text": "I got these magic sparkly sneakers,"
  },
  {
    "index": 493,
    "text": "and then I met a very nice Scarecrow."
  },
  {
    "index": 494,
    "text": "That's me!"
  },
  {
    "index": 495,
    "text": "Ooh! All that stuff. Keep it coming."
  },
  {
    "index": 496,
    "text": "Then we met the Bad Witch"
  },
  {
    "index": 497,
    "text": "and some cute Lunchin' Munchkins."
  },
  {
    "index": 498,
    "text": "Don't forget Baby Tin Box"
  },
  {
    "index": 499,
    "text": "and Marty the Party Lion."
  },
  {
    "index": 500,
    "text": "They all helped us along the way"
  },
  {
    "index": 501,
    "text": "so we could get here"
  },
  {
    "index": 502,
    "text": "and ask the great and paw-esome Wizard"
  },
  {
    "index": 503,
    "text": "to bring our story back."
  },
  {
    "index": 504,
    "text": "-Don't forget the big ending."
  },
  {
    "index": 505,
    "text": "-Huh?"
  },
  {
    "index": 506,
    "text": "The part where the Wizard of Meow"
  },
  {
    "index": 507,
    "text": "solves all your problems."
  },
  {
    "index": 508,
    "text": "The story is back!"
  },
  {
    "index": 509,
    "text": "And we're all in it!"
  },
  {
    "index": 510,
    "text": "That's beautiful."
  },
  {
    "index": 511,
    "text": "Thank you, CatRat!"
  },
  {
    "index": 512,
    "text": "You're the best!"
  },
  {
    "index": 513,
    "text": "Aw, shucks!"
  },
  {
    "index": 514,
    "text": "We have got to get this home"
  },
  {
    "index": 515,
    "text": "and show Floyd."
  },
  {
    "index": 516,
    "text": "He's going to be so excited."
  },
  {
    "index": 517,
    "text": "Okay."
  },
  {
    "index": 518,
    "text": "Three clicks of my sparkly sneaks"
  },
  {
    "index": 519,
    "text": "should get us home."
  },
  {
    "index": 520,
    "text": "-Ready, Pandy?"
  },
  {
    "index": 521,
    "text": "-Ready."
  },
  {
    "index": 522,
    "text": "One,"
  },
  {
    "index": 523,
    "text": "two, three!"
  },
  {
    "index": 524,
    "text": "Whoa! Now, that was an adventure."
  },
  {
    "index": 525,
    "text": "And check out our storybook. Look!"
  },
  {
    "index": 526,
    "text": "We're on the cover. Pretty cool, huh?"
  },
  {
    "index": 527,
    "text": "Thanks so much for all your help"
  },
  {
    "index": 528,
    "text": "getting our story back."
  },
  {
    "index": 529,
    "text": "We couldn't have done it without you."
  },
  {
    "index": 530,
    "text": "Are you ready for one more surprise?"
  },
  {
    "index": 531,
    "text": "♪ Gabby Cat, Gabby Cat ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 532,
    "text": "♪ Gabby Cat, Gabby Cat ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 533,
    "text": "♪ Gabby Cat, Gabby Cat ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 534,
    "text": "♪ Gabby Cat, Gabby Cat ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 535,
    "text": "♪ Gabby Cat, Gabby Cat"
  },
  {
    "index": 536,
    "text": "Gabby Cat, Gabby Cat ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 537,
    "text": "♪ Gabby Cat of the Day! ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 538,
    "text": "It's me, MerCat."
  },
  {
    "index": 539,
    "text": "MerCat in the house,"
  },
  {
    "index": 540,
    "text": "about to drop some Spa Science."
  },
  {
    "index": 541,
    "text": "Come on!"
  },
  {
    "index": 542,
    "text": "♪ Welcome to my bubbly world ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 543,
    "text": "♪ Fizzy, foamy, color swirls ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 544,
    "text": "♪ Meow, meow, meow, meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 545,
    "text": "♪ Gonna make you smile"
  },
  {
    "index": 546,
    "text": "Let you see how scientific you can be ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 547,
    "text": "♪ Meow, meow, meow, meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 548,
